# Quality gates — ai-conceitual-teste

> **Non-negotiable:** every commit (local included) must pass `npm run verify`.

## Hard caps

| Metric | Cap |
|--------|-----|
| File lines | **waived** |
| Function lines | **waived** |
| Cyclomatic complexity | ≤ **10** |
| Lint | **0** errors, **0** warnings |
| System / typecheck | **0** errors when tooling exists |

## Before every commit

```bash
npm run verify
```

Do not commit if any gate fails.

Full doc: `docs/QUALITY-GATES.md`. Harness reference: `agent-rules/00-core/size-and-complexity-limits.md`.
